  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1725961807_7853634_c2af50d41f1723e474a582bd29d112b0.jpg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><h1 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Medium, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 3rem; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-bottom: 1rem;\" class=\"display-5 lh-2 mb-3\">Introducing<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">PACEPUTT™</h1><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 300; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 1.5rem;\" class=\"lead mt-4\">The revolutionary golf putting trainer that will quickly help reduce strokes on the putting green for golfers of all abilities.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 300; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"lead\">Putting is arguably the most important part of the game, especially at higher levels of play.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 300; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"lead\"><br></p><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Medium, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 2rem; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1; text-align: center;\" class=\"lh-1 mb-3 text-center\">Discover PACEPUTT™</h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 300; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-align: center;\" class=\"lead text-center mb-4\">PACEPUTT™ is the revolutionary putting aid that trains you to hit putts at the perfect pace, which means:</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;You hole way more of the makeable putts you're missing.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;Eradicates racing the ball past the hole and leaving you the nervy ones back.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;Stops you from nervously lagging your putts so they don't race by… meaning you never hole them and worse still, leave yourself a nervy one 3ft short!</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;You know exactly what pace you should hit your putts, so that even if you get your line wrong, you're always a tap in away.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;You decide the length of putt you're 100% confident holing and never be more than that distance away (after your first putt)</p><h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Medium, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 1.5rem; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center mb-4\">Why pace is so important:</h4><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;The correct line is dictated by the pace - a 'correct' line at the wrong pace will still result in a miss.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;Too little pace on a putt, will leave it vulnerable to green imperfections and result in good putts missing.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;Too much pace can leave you with a putt back you're not 100% confident in holing.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;Being nervous of over-hitting, can result in you leaving putts far too short and increasing your chances of a 3-putt.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;Lots of putts 'lip out' due to incorrect pace.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;When you practice pace putting before you go out, you'll reduce your strokes by eliminating three-putts.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;The optimum pace will result in you holing more makeable putts.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; font-family: Gotham-Book, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\" class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;When your pace is right, your confidence will dramatically increase.</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>PLEASE VISIT www.paceputt.com to find out more.&nbsp;<br><br></p></div>",
